This directory contains source files for KLIC system, a portable
implementation of a concurrent logic proramming language KL1.

The newest version is in klic-2.002.tgz that contains:

  - KL1 to C compiler
  - runtime system
  - documents (manual and tutorial) in English
  - old manual in Japanese
  - beta version of a distributed parallel implementation upon PVM
  - beta version of a shared memory parallel implementation on
    SPARCCenter and DEC Alpha.

Some bugs in klic-2.000 were fixed.

The next version which corresponds to several parallel machines
will be released in May 1995.

May 1995
